{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":66115,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793370256404,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2016,"episodeCount":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9fONH0JLjIm2OwLsd0ZPiC75rOR.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1183442","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"猿楽製薬での大規模事故と失踪した番場宗介を追うジャーナリスト・川上。ある時、事故に関わる情報を掴んだ川上は空港を訪れていた。そこで旅客機から乗客全員が消失する怪事件に遭遇。唯一生き残ったCAが語った真相とは…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/noXNv6AeW4AZ8fGFsZLeJUeGCy7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/noXNv6AeW4AZ8fGFsZLeJUeGCy7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"1185132","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"豪雨の中、岬を走る寝台列車を海から来た何かが襲う。運転手を失い、制御不能となった列車は、崖に突き進む。番場を護送中の岩崎刑事は事故を免れるため、やむを得ず協力を求めるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jTfuyJBvjmsv54u0hnQo7Y2kpXI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jTfuyJBvjmsv54u0hnQo7Y2kpXI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"1185133","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"恋人・ユミカと山奥にある秘湯を訪れたタツヤ。しかしユミカは忽然と姿を消してしまう。旅館の従業員達は、最初からタツヤ一人だったと口をそろえるが…。秘湯に潜む呪われた儀式を目撃する…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jiBocunoX6jwKibIIDnS5cFW7nK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jiBocunoX6jwKibIIDnS5cFW7nK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"1185134","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"猿楽本社に連行された番場は、極秘任務に同行させられる。同社の兵器化実験の失敗で奇獣が氾濫した町に潜入、研究チームの甲斐博士を救出しようとするが、奇獣の群れに取り囲まれてしまう…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5kng4GNt1hQKxJZco6T5QyjFvrk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5kng4GNt1hQKxJZco6T5QyjFvrk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"1475026","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突然鳴り響いた謎の音に、番場は身動きを封じられてしまう。苦しむ番場、その姿をあざ笑うかのように一人の少女現れる。一方、木村は一連の騒動の背後で蠢く思惑に気がつき、回避しようとするが…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wh1CAw4zDaZrj7cDewf4VU3plKm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wh1CAw4zDaZrj7cDewf4VU3plKm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"1475027","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場を襲った事件の真相が明らかになる。それは木村も知り得ない新たな奇獣計画の一部だった。そんな中さらなる奇獣事件が発生。猿楽研究員・秋良とその娘・莉央が襲われてしまう…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4c7oTbTVa1ZU0tGIQQoDdwYn2s5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4c7oTbTVa1ZU0tGIQQoDdwYn2s5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"1475028","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"霧子は、猿楽の研究所より脱走したある貴重な奇獣を追っていた。その奇獣は番場宗介と同じく、人間の知性を残したまま、影鰐の能力を備えているという。 ついに発見し確保したのだが…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/whG4ROV5RzPXSHWoOn4kZLtuPXL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whG4ROV5RzPXSHWoOn4kZLtuPXL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"1475029","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場宗介は、猿楽製薬に囚われていた。検体として投薬を繰り返される中、謎の夢を見る。それは影鰐に関わるある記憶だった。番場は、影鰐を生み出した者、影鰐に喰われた者、そして一人生き残った者を目撃する！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2va6tXm2wjstR2HfIzwXmO1APMz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2va6tXm2wjstR2HfIzwXmO1APMz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"1475030","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場は、本間局長率いるチームの研究施設に運び込まれていた。そこで行われるのは、奇獣や番場を利用した新たな生物兵器の生成、そしてビジネス――。本間に体の自由を奪われ、兵器生成の検体に組み込まれる番場。脱出不可能の危機が迫る…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2kQ87JDpHLYOxikvUBqfqZYKeaM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2kQ87JDpHLYOxikvUBqfqZYKeaM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"1475031","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"木村の協力により猿楽研究施設を抜け出した番場は影鰐を追う。その頃、ナギは奇獣の気配を辿り、ある廃墟の町に辿り着いた。一人の少女と一夜をともにすることになったのだが…。奇獣と母を失った記憶、二つの悪夢がナギに襲いかかる…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uKaTUwPFoxeDMEbV7KCJ1zWzoS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKaTUwPFoxeDMEbV7KCJ1zWzoS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"1475032","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場と木村は雲南省の廃村にたどり着く。そこはかつて蟲毒の儀式が行われ、影鰐が潜む忌まわしき場所。意を決する番場の前に、鋭く突き刺さる槍、いつの間にか忍び寄る影鰐。ついに死闘の幕があける…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v5A9cjm6RQoXiIyaQ1eQobkQhtn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5A9cjm6RQoXiIyaQ1eQobkQhtn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"1475033","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"追い詰められた影鰐の力は悍ましいほど強大だった。だが番場の目は生きていた。クローンを解放し、身を奇獣化させながら、最後の闘いに挑む番場。脈々と続く負の連鎖、そして復讐、番場は影鰐と人間の因縁を断ち切ることはできるのか…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jrmROIMU7sEu6ypeyYFI463dqV3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jrmROIMU7sEu6ypeyYFI463dqV3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/12"},{"id":"1475034","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"木村のねらいは全ての始祖である影鰐の力を手にすることだった。圧倒的な力を手に入れ、自らを選ばれし者と称する木村に対し、番場とナギは為す術もない。過ちの代償は受け継がれて行く。物語の終わりと共に――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p7Ks7HaWW7UAdoChzK7eas3SHW1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p7Ks7HaWW7UAdoChzK7eas3SHW1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/2/episode/13"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.o